## on the name itself
  EContains expr expr
            ~~~~     

## first argument
  EContains expr expr
            ~~~~     

## second argument
  EContains expr expr
                 ~~~~

## inside the second
  EContains expr expr
                 ~~~~

## nested call
  ENum int
       ~~~

## after a nested call
  EContains expr expr
                 ~~~~

## function argument
  $lookup(state, expr)
          ~~~~~       

## second function argument
  $lookup(state, expr)
                 ~~~~ 

## comma inside a nested call
  $lookup(state, expr)
                 ~~~~ 

## relation, first
  Eval: state |- expr ==> value
        ~~~~~                  

## relation, past the turnstile
  Eval: state |- expr ==> value
                 ~~~~          

